{"seq":9,"slug":"robotics-engineering","title":"机器人工程","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"机器人工程-简介\">机器人工程 简介</h1><p>机器人工程是一门融合机械设计、电气控制、计算机科学与人工智能的综合性交叉学科。随着智能制造、服务机器人和具身智能的快速发展，机器人工程已成为现代工程教育中最具前景的方向之一。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向大学机器人工程专业学生，系统梳理从机械结构到智能决策的完整知识体系，帮助学习者建立&quot;硬件-控制-感知-智能&quot;四位一体的工程能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容概览\">内容概览</h2><p><strong>第一章 机械设计基础</strong> 聚焦机器人本体设计，涵盖机构学与运动学分析、驱动器与传动系统选型、以及结构力学优化方法，为机器人提供坚实的物理载体。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章 电气控制系统</strong> 深入嵌入式系统编程、传感器与信号处理、运动控制算法三大核心，构建机器人&quot;神经系统&quot;的完整链路，实现从感知信号到执行动作的闭环控制。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章 智能感知</strong> 探索机器视觉系统、SLAM与自主导航、多传感器融合等前沿技术，赋予机器人理解和感知周围环境的能力。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章 智能算法与系统集成</strong> 从 ROS 框架开发到运动规划与决策、再到人机交互，将各模块整合为一个完整的机器人系统，实现自主决策与协作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>建议按章节顺序循序渐进：先掌握机械设计的物理基础，再学习电气控制实现精确运动，然后深入感知系统获取环境信息，最后通过智能算法完成系统集成。每章均配有实践案例与思考题，鼓励结合 ROS2 仿真环境进行动手验证。</p>\n<p>具备高等数学、线性代数、C/C++ 编程和基础电路理论知识的学习者将获得最佳学习效果。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mechanical-design-fundamentals","title":"机械设计基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/mechanical-design-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"robot-mechanisms-kinematics","title":"机器人机构学与运动学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/mechanical-design-fundamentals/robot-mechanisms-kinematics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"actuators-and-drive-systems","title":"驱动器与传动系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/mechanical-design-fundamentals/actuators-and-drive-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"structural-design-optimization","title":"结构设计与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/mechanical-design-fundamentals/structural-design-optimization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"electrical-control-systems","title":"电气控制系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/electrical-control-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"embedded-systems-programming","title":"嵌入式系统编程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/electrical-control-systems/embedded-systems-programming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sensors-and-signal-processing","title":"传感器与信号处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/electrical-control-systems/sensors-and-signal-processing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"motion-control-algorithms","title":"运动控制算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/electrical-control-systems/motion-control-algorithms"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"intelligent-perception","title":"智能感知","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/intelligent-perception","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"machine-vision-systems","title":"机器视觉系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/intelligent-perception/machine-vision-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"slam-and-navigation","title":"SLAM与自主导航","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/intelligent-perception/slam-and-navigation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-sensor-fusion","title":"多传感器融合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/intelligent-perception/multi-sensor-fusion"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"intelligent-algorithms-integration","title":"智能算法与系统集成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/intelligent-algorithms-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ros-framework-development","title":"ROS框架开发","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/intelligent-algorithms-integration/ros-framework-development"},{"seq":2,"slug":"motion-planning-decision","title":"运动规划与决策","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/robotics-engineering/intelligent-algorithms-integration/motion-planning-decision"},{"seq":3,"slug":"human-robot-interaction","title":"人机交互","url":"/l-doc-books/education/univ